Caption: 🍎 Rustic Lattice-Top Apple Pie 🥧

Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🥟 Double pie crust, 🍎 6 large Granny Smith apples (peeled and sliced), 🍬 3/4 cup sugar, 🪵 2 tsp cinnamon, 🌰 1/4 tsp nutmeg, 🍋 1 tbsp lemon juice, 🧈 2 tbsp butter, and 🥚 1 egg for wash. 
Steps: 🍎 Toss apple slices with sugar, spices, and lemon juice. 🥧 Line a pie dish with the bottom crust and fill with apples. 🔪 Cut the remaining crust into strips and weave a lattice over the top. 🥟 Crimp the edges and brush with egg wash. ⏲️ Bake at 375°F (190°C) for 50-60 minutes until the crust is golden and the filling is bubbling.

